"they took it. look at them go."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-002","slides":[{"text":"the whole crew is one volunteer"},{"text":"and a tripod."},{"text":"show me another network that effective."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-004","slides":[{"text":"your town had a channel like this."},{"text":"you never watched it."},{"text":"we forgive you. kinda."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-005","slides":[{"text":"the sound guy is the host's cousin."},{"text":"the sound is still pretty good."},{"text":"explain that."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-006","slides":[{"text":"in 1972 the fcc told big-city cable companies"},{"text":"to hand over channels"},{"text":"to anyone who walked in."},{"text":"no auditions. no gatekeepers. no taste."},{"text":"a court struck it down in 1979."},{"text":"the cities wrote it into their cable contracts anyway."},{"text":"that's how much somebody wanted you to have this."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-007","slides":[{"text":"no label ever signed them."},{"text":"the station gave them a time slot instead."},{"text":"honestly, still a good deal."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-008","slides":[{"text":"one take."},{"text":"that was the entire budget for takes."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-009","slides":[{"text":"somewhere in a basement"},{"text":"there's a vhs master with a band's whole career on it."},{"text":"the band broke up in 2009."},{"text":"the tape doesn't know that. it doesn't need to."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-010","slides":[{"text":"most of these acts rehearsed in a living room"},{"text":"just push the furniture back to make room."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-011","slides":[{"text":"first place was a trophy"},{"text":"from the trophy shop on main street."},{"text":"hey, a trophy's a trophy."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-012","slides":[{"text":"the community media center had one rule:"},{"text":"take the training class,"},{"text":"and the airwaves were yours."},{"text":"imagine handing out television"},{"text":"like a library card."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-013","slides":[{"text":"canned applause was invented"},{"text":"for shows that couldn't earn the real thing."},{"text":"everything you hear here is earned."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-014","slides":[{"text":"nobody involved got paid."},{"text":"listen to how little that mattered."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-015","slides":[{"text":"a band you've never heard of"},{"text":"booked studio time on a wednesday,"},{"text":"borrowed a fourth amp,"},{"text":"and played the tightest set of their lives"},{"text":"for one camera and a station volunteer."},{"text":"then they went back to their day jobs."},{"text":"somebody kept the tape."},{"text":"here you go."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-016","slides":[{"text":"somewhere out there is a band"},{"text":"whose entire television career"},{"text":"lives right here."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-017","slides":[{"text":"battle of the bands rules:"},{"text":"three songs, twenty minutes, load your own gear."},{"text":"somebody's dad ran the p.a. system."},{"text":"somebody's little sister screamed loudest."},{"text":"the trophy went home in a hatchback."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-018","slides":[{"text":"no manager. no tour. no merch table."},{"text":"just a tuesday and a microphone."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-019","slides":[{"text":"this is what television sounds like"},{"text":"when nobody's selling you anything."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-020","slides":[{"text":"a kid walks up to a microphone"},{"text":"in a gym that echoes like a canyon."},{"text":"sings anyway."},{"text":"nails it."},{"text":"try and find that on a modern streaming service."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-021","slides":[{"text":"every talent show has one act"},{"text":"nobody saw coming."},{"text":"the quiet kid. the librarian."},{"text":"somebody's grandfather with a harmonica."},{"text":"the whole gym goes silent,"},{"text":"then loses its mind."},{"text":"you never know which act it'll be."},{"text":"that's why you stay to the end."},{"text":"open mic."}]},{"id":"om-022","slides":[{"text":"cable companies fought public access for decades."},{"text":"they lost."},{"text":"you're watching the win."},{"text":"open mic."}]}],"audio":[{"filename":"jaffe-back-to-normal.mp3","title":"Back To Normal","artist":"Jaffe","url":"https://archive.org/details/SongsAboutBoys","license":"by"},{"filename":"jaffe-give-us-all-your-money.mp3","title":"Give Us All Your Money","artist":"Jaffe","url":"https://archive.org/details/SongsAboutBoys","license":"by"},{"filename":"1000000-ad-shy-bay.mp3","title":"Shy Bay","artist":"1000000 a.d.","url":"https://archive.org/details/4TrackFromThe4TrackVolume2","license":"by"},{"filename":"1000000-ad-meet-and-greet-at-the-capris.mp3","title":"Meet And Greet At The Capris","artist":"1000000 a.d.","url":"https://archive.org/details/4TrackFromThe4TrackVolume2","license":"by"},{"filename":"matt-builds-character-personal-truth.mp3","title":"Personal Truth","artist":"Matt Builds Character","url":"https://archive.org/details/SPNet075-MattBuildsCharacter-MyBedroomRevolution","license":"by-sa"},{"filename":"matt-builds-character-i-walk-down-whispering-roads.mp3","title":"I Walk Down Whispering Roads","artist":"Matt Builds Character","url":"https://archive.org/details/SPNet075-MattBuildsCharacter-MyBedroomRevolution","license":"by-sa"},{"filename":"litmus0001-weakness-pt-1.mp3","title":"Weakness Pt. 1","artist":"litmus0001","url":"https://archive.org/details/anu014_litmus0001_east_bay_sunrise","license":"by"}],"platform":"platform/95999340c48fb6d6.json"}